{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1c1809dc5c0852a24fd2e98a16f1c48a0099bb5a8076dad64ee116379fb4b925","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["第七印和香爐"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["羔羊揭開第七印的時候，天上寂靜約有二刻。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我看見那站在上帝面前的七位天使，有七枝號賜給他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["另有一位天使，拿着金香爐來，站在祭壇旁邊。有許多香賜給他，要和眾聖徒的祈禱一同獻在寶座前的金壇上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那香的煙和眾聖徒的祈禱從天使的手中一同升到上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["天使拿着香爐，盛滿了壇上的火，倒在地上；隨有雷轟、大聲、閃電、地震。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["七號"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["拿着七枝號的七位天使就預備要吹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一位天使吹號，就有雹子與火攙着血丟在地上；地的三分之一和樹的三分之一被燒了，一切的青草也被燒了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二位天使吹號，就有彷彿火燒着的大山扔在海中；海的三分之一變成血，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["海中的活物死了三分之一，船隻也壞了三分之一。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["第三位天使吹號，就有燒着的大星，好像火把從天上落下來，落在江河的三分之一和眾水的泉源上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["（這星名叫「茵蔯」。）眾水的三分之一變為茵蔯，因水變苦，就死了許多人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["第四位天使吹號，日頭的三分之一、月亮的三分之一、星辰的三分之一都被擊打，以致日月星的三分之一黑暗了，白晝的三分之一沒有光，黑夜也是這樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我又看見一個鷹飛在空中，並聽見牠大聲說：「三位天使要吹那其餘的號。你們住在地上的民，禍哉！禍哉！禍哉！」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/REV/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}